1-25/491823994_1935798273623180_9023901920183873423_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TuzxEu7Gg1QQ7kNvwEtHPgV&_nc_oc=AdpXh8zcD3w8fkBkoRo7khPdMUvprXt4eG4TBB9rdlMN5aQdkueU837OMX3s4ga-TnI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRTIhSzOFbvB1A0YNW5C4S0cYcICKY5tuhtqeElJ_iHSQ&oe=6B0DC5EB"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1412724262945032", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499318074_1412724266278365_4253179642551190540_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=njPwDlXZvQ8Q7kNvwFV8mRC&_nc_oc=AdqOAvKgU3E7A60yNzuHY8-X3HMWMfH_sYiJl4e96-UQ-22tGP4WtRUdV_5KwGnJ9EQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTQRV5Zwlfeb0vajPj42LFdeIboXpvb7igvy5opwifa0A&oe=6B0D9C0E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MR Drone Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Master drone flying in minutes\u2014no crashes, no consequences.\nMR Drone Simulator: Learn to Fly is a beginner-friendly mixed reality simulator built for Meta Quest. It blends your real-world surroundings with immersive training missions, teaching you how to fly a virtual drone safely and confidently.\nWhether you're a new drone owner, a student, or just curious about drone tech, this is the perfect starting point.\n Key Features:\nMixed Reality Training: Fly a virtual drone in your own space using passthrough\n\n\nStep-by-Step Lessons: Start with takeoff, hovering, and safe landings\n\n\nRealistic Controls: Master pitch, roll, yaw, and throttle with intuitive inputs\n\n\nImmersive Practice Environments: Overlay your room with training zones, targets, and obstacles\n\n\nProgress Tracking: Earn badges and advance through beginner levels\n\n\nThis is your risk-free, crash-proof launchpad to the skies.\n", "short_description": "Learn drone flying basics with mixed reality training in your real space.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_p